<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header class="header">
            <div class="heading-container">
                <h1 class="heading">The Career</h1>
                <h1 class="heading">Aptitude Test</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="result" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
                <h4>
                    RESULTS FOR: <b>
                        <%= answer.user_name %>
                    </b>
                </h4>
                <!-- <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px;">Jan 18, 2021 -8:37AM</p> -->
                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px;">
                    <%= answer.formattedDate %>
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>
        <div style="margin: 10px 50px 50px 50px;">
            <!-- <a style="color: green;" href="#scroll-to" id="scroll-link">My
                scrolling</a> -->
            <!-- <h1 style="color: red;">Section 1.</h1> -->
            <section>
                <div>
                    <p>
                        Your report is divided into distinct sections, each
                        focusing on various aspects crucial to
                        your career exploration. It delves into your
                        interests, personality, and identifies job roles
                        and work environments that align with your
                        strengths. Additionally, you'll receive
                        personalized guidance and recommendations to help
                        you navigate your career options
                        effectively and plan a successful job search
                        strategy.
                    </p>
                    <h3 class="vertical-space">
                        Your personality patterns
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Personality patterns refer to the configurations of
                        traits and characteristics that
                        individuals exhibit consistently across different
                        situations and contexts. These patterns
                        provide a framework for understanding how various
                        personality traits interact and
                        influence behavior, cognition, and emotion.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        One way to visualize personality patterns is through
                        the use of a circumplex graph. A
                        circumplex graph is a circular diagram that
                        represents the interrelationships among
                        different personality traits based on their
                        proximity to one another on the circle.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        By plotting various personality traits on the
                        circumplex graph, we can identify specific
                        personality patterns or profiles that capture the
                        configuration of traits exhibited by
                        individuals.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Each circumplex has four sections, with each section
                        describing a typical pattern. The
                        area of each section shows how well that pattern
                        describes you. A larger area indicates
                        a better fit for that pattern.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Some of your circumplex graphs will show a clear
                        preference for one pattern. Others will
                        show a more even spread across two or three
                        patterns. Where you have nearly equal
                        scores for two or three patterns you can expect that
                        both or all three patterns describe
                        you equally well.
                    </p>
                    <h3 class="vertical-space">
                        Your core pattern
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        At the heart of every individual lies a unique core
                        pattern that defines their essence.
                        This pattern encompasses a combination of core
                        values, motivations, and ways of
                        thinking that shape who they are at their core.
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        Core values serve as the guiding principles that
                        govern a person's beliefs, behaviors, and
                        decision-making processes. These values reflect what
                        is most important to them and
                        often influence their choices in various aspects of
                        life, including relationships, career,
                        and personal development.
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        Motivations drive a person's actions and desires,
                        fueling their pursuit of goals and
                        aspirations. Whether driven by a desire for
                        achievement, personal growth, or making a
                        difference in the world, motivations play a
                        significant role in shaping a person's
                        trajectory and sense of fulfillment.
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        Way of thinking encompasses the cognitive processes
                        and mental frameworks through
                        which a person interprets the world around them. It
                        includes their perspectives,
                        attitudes, problem-solving approaches, and patterns
                        of reasoning. A person's way of
                        thinking influences how they perceive challenges,
                        opportunities, and experiences,
                        ultimately shaping their responses and behaviors.
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        Together, these elements form the core pattern of a
                        person, representing the
                        foundation of their identity and character.
                        Understanding this core pattern is essential
                        for self-awareness, personal growth, and building
                        meaningful connections with others. It
                        provides insight into what drives and inspires an
                        individual, guiding them in their
                        journey towards fulfillment and authenticity.
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        So, as explained above, the circumplex below
                        illustrates the main role you take on
                        approaching your surroundings. This role presents
                        your core values, motivations and
                        your general way of thinking.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <!-- personality pattern -->
            <!-- personality pattern -->

            <!-- <h1 style="color: red;">Section 2.</h1> -->
            <section>
                <!-- core_pattern -->
                <div class="pattern-section ">
                    <div class="flex-container">
                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 35%;">
                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space"
                                    style="text-align: left; color: rgb(97 179 97 / 59%);">
                                    <b>
                                        Empathic Idealist
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important;text-align:left;">
                                    Indicates an open-minded and
                                    imaginative nature, with a tendency
                                    to appreciate
                                    creativity and diverse perspectives.
                                    Could lean towards high
                                    extraversion, involving social
                                    warmth, or low extraversion,
                                    reflecting a more reserved and
                                    reflective demeanor.
                                    Empathy can manifest in both
                                    outgoing and introspective ways.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space"
                                    style="text-align: left; color: rgb(133 119 175);">
                                    <b>
                                        Easygoing Explorer
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important;text-align: left;">
                                    This individual is generally
                                    laid-back and even-tempered.
                                    Prefers a flexible and
                                    spontaneous
                                    approach to life, valuing
                                    freedom
                                    over rigid structures.
                                    Thrives in environments that
                                    allow
                                    for exploration, creativity, and
                                    a
                                    more carefree approach.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 1px;">
                            <div>
                                <canvas id="chartId" aria-label="chart" height="200px" width="200px"></canvas>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 35%;">
                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space"
                                    style="text-align: left; color: rgb(0 67 255 / 45%);">
                                    <b>
                                        Driven Achiever
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important;text-align: left;">
                                    This individual is ambitious and
                                    goal-oriented, focusing on personal
                                    achievement.
                                    Values efficiency, order, and
                                    reliability in both personal and
                                    professional endeavors.
                                    Thrives in environments where
                                    individual success, organization,
                                    and high achievement are valued.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space" style="text-align: left; color: #ffa50187;">
                                    <b>
                                        Emotionally Reactive Free
                                        Spirit
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important;text-align: left;">
                                    Prefers a spontaneous and
                                    flexible
                                    lifestyle, often resisting
                                    structured plans.
                                    May face challenges in
                                    maintaining
                                    organization and consistency in
                                    tasks.
                                    Thrives in environments that
                                    allow
                                    for emotional expression and a
                                    more
                                    carefree approach to life.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- <h1 style="color: red;">Section 3.</h1> -->
            <section>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="vertical-space">
                        Your interpersonal pattern
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        The interpersonal pattern of a person encompasses
                        their unique style of relating to
                        others, developing relationships, and socializing.
                        This pattern reflects the individual's
                        preferences, behaviors, and communication styles in
                        interpersonal interactions.
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        At the core of the interpersonal pattern is the
                        individual's style of relating to others. This
                        includes aspects such as their level of extroversion
                        or introversion, communication
                        preferences, and comfort with social interactions.
                        Some individuals may be naturally
                        outgoing and expressive, while others may be more
                        reserved and contemplative in their
                        approach to socializing.
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        Developing relationships is another key aspect of
                        the interpersonal pattern. This
                        involves the individual's ability to initiate and
                        nurture connections with others, as well as
                        their approach to building trust and intimacy. Some
                        individuals may be highly relational,
                        seeking deep and meaningful connections with others,
                        while others may prioritize a
                        broader network of acquaintances and colleagues.
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        Socializing encompasses the ways in which
                        individuals engage with others in social
                        settings. This includes their preferences for social
                        activities, group dynamics, and
                        communication styles in social contexts. Some
                        individuals may thrive in large social
                        gatherings and enjoy being the center of attention,
                        while others may prefer more
                        intimate settings and one-on-one interactions.
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        Overall, the interpersonal pattern of a person
                        shapes how they engage with others,
                        form relationships, and navigate social
                        interactions. Understanding this pattern is
                        essential for effective communication, building
                        rapport, and fostering healthy
                        connections with others. It provides insight into
                        the individual's social needs,
                        preferences, and strengths, guiding them in
                        cultivating fulfilling relationships and
                        navigating social dynamics with confidence and
                        authenticity
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        So, as explained above, the circumplex below
                        illustrates the style you use in relation to
                        others. This style governs the way you develop
                        relationships and socializing.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- <h1 style="color: red;">Section 4.</h1> -->
            <section>
                <!-- interpersonal_pattern -->
                <div class="pattern-section">
                    <div class="flex-container">
                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 35%;">
                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space"
                                    style="text-align: left;color: rgb(97 179 97 / 59%)">
                                    <b>
                                        Social Connector
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important; text-align: left;">
                                    Enjoys socializing and building
                                    positive relationships.
                                    Values harmony and cooperation in
                                    social interactions.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space" style="text-align: left;color: rgb(133 119 175);">
                                    <b>
                                        Assertive Leader
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important; text-align: left;">
                                    Confident, outgoing, and
                                    assertive in social situations.
                                    Values taking charge and
                                    influencing others.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 1px;">
                            <div>
                                <canvas id="chartId_one" aria-label="chart" height="200px" width="200px"></canvas>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 35%;">
                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space"
                                    style="text-align: left; color: rgb(0 67 255 / 45%);">
                                    <b>
                                        Independent Observer
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important; text-align: left;">
                                    Prefers observing rather than
                                    actively engaging in social
                                    interactions.
                                    Values personal space and may be
                                    more reserved in social situations.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space" style="text-align: left; color: #ffa50187;">
                                    <b>
                                        Empathetic Helper
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important; text-align: left;">
                                    Compassionate, cooperative, and
                                    considerate of others.
                                    Enjoys helping and supporting
                                    those around them in social
                                    settings.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- <h1 style="color: red;">Section 5.</h1> -->
            <section>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="vertical-space">
                        Your communication pattern
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        The communication pattern of a person encompasses
                        their unique style, preferences,
                        and behaviors in conveying information, expressing
                        thoughts and emotions, and
                        engaging in dialogue with others.
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        At the core of the communication pattern is the
                        individual's communication style. This
                        includes aspects such as their verbal and nonverbal
                        communication cues, tone of voice,
                        body language, and listening skills. Some
                        individuals may be naturally assertive and
                        direct in their communication, while others may be
                        more passive or diplomatic in their
                        approach.
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        Preferences in communication also play a significant
                        role in the communication pattern.
                        This involves the individual's preferred modes of
                        communication, such as face-to-face
                        conversations, phone calls, written messages, or
                        digital communication channels. Some
                        individuals may prefer synchronous communication
                        methods that allow for real-time
                        interaction, while others may prefer asynchronous
                        methods that provide flexibility and
                        time for reflection
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        Behaviors in communication encompass the ways in
                        which individuals engage in
                        dialogue, express themselves, and respond to others.
                        This includes their communication
                        norms, patterns of speech, and strategies for
                        conveying messages effectively. Some
                        individuals may be skilled at active listening and
                        empathy, while others may struggle
                        with assertiveness or clarity in their communication
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        Overall, the communication pattern of a person
                        shapes how they interact with others,
                        convey information, and build relationships.
                        Understanding this pattern is essential for
                        effective communication, resolving conflicts, and
                        fostering mutual understanding and
                        collaboration. It provides insight into the
                        individual's communication strengths,
                        preferences, and areas for growth, guiding them in
                        enhancing their communication skills
                        and navigating interpersonal interactions with
                        confidence and clarity
                    </p>
                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                        So, as explained above, the circumplex below
                        illustrates how you communicate your
                        thoughts, ideas and experiences to others. This
                        pattern reflects the style you use for
                        communication
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- <h1 style="color: red;">Section 6.</h1> -->
            <section>
                <!-- communication_pattern -->
                <div class="pattern-section ">
                    <div class="flex-container">
                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 35%;">
                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space"
                                    style="text-align: left;color: rgb(97 179 97 / 59%);">
                                    <b>
                                        Expressive Innovator
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important; text-align: left;">
                                    Enjoys expressing ideas and emotions
                                    openly in communication.
                                    Values creativity and exploring new
                                    concepts.
                                    Communicates with enthusiasm and is
                                    open to diverse perspectives.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space" style="text-align: left;color: rgb(133 119 175);">
                                    <b>
                                        Empathetic Communicator
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important;text-align: left;">
                                    Attuned to the emotions of
                                    others and provides empathetic
                                    communication.
                                    Values creating a supportive and
                                    emotionally safe space in
                                    conversations.
                                    Communicates with sensitivity
                                    and a focus on emotional
                                    well-being.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 1px;">
                            <div>
                                <canvas id="chartId_two" aria-label="chart" height="200px" width="200px"></canvas>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 35%;">
                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space"
                                    style="text-align: left;color: rgb(0 67 255 / 45%)">
                                    <b>
                                        Thoughtful Communicator
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important;text-align: left;">
                                    Prefers thoughtful and precise
                                    communication.
                                    Values clarity, organization, and
                                    attention to detail.
                                    Communicates in a purposeful and
                                    systematic manner.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space" style="text-align: left; color: #ffa50187;">
                                    <b>
                                        Calm Communicator
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important; text-align: left;">
                                    Maintains emotional stability
                                    during communication.
                                    Values rational discussion and
                                    open-minded exploration of
                                    ideas.
                                    Communicates in a calm and
                                    composed manner, even in
                                    challenging situations.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
