            <!-- Start Openness: -->
            <section>
                <div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="vertical-space">
                            Openness
                        </h3>
                        <p>
                            Refers to the extent to which individuals are
                            open to new experiences, ideas, and
                            values. It reflects a person's intellectual
                            curiosity, creativity, and receptivity to novel
                            concepts.
                        </p>
                        <p class="top-extra-space">
                            Individuals who score <span class="bold-text">high in Openness</span>
                            tend to exhibit
                            certain characteristic traits and
                            behaviors that distinguish them from those who
                            score lower on this personality
                            dimension. Here are some key points about people
                            high in Openness:
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li class="list-item">
                                <span class="bold-text">Curiosity and
                                    Interest in Novelty:</span> High
                                Openness
                                individuals are characterized by
                                their insatiable curiosity and interest in
                                novel ideas, experiences, and perspectives.
                                They often seek out new and unconventional
                                ways of thinking and may enjoy
                                exploring diverse topics and concepts.
                            </li>
                            <li class="list-item">
                                <span class="bold-text">Imagination and
                                    Creativity:</span> People high in
                                Openness
                                possess rich inner lives and vivid
                                imaginations. They are often highly creative
                                and may express themselves through
                                various artistic outlets such as writing,
                                painting, music, or design. They enjoy
                                engaging in imaginative activities and may
                                have a penchant for exploring abstract
                                concepts.
                            </li>
                            <li class="list-item">
                                <span class="bold-text">Adventurous
                                    Spirit:</span> High Openness individuals
                                have an
                                adventurous spirit and a
                                willingness to explore new territories, both
                                literally and metaphorically. They may
                                enjoy traveling to unfamiliar places, trying
                                new foods, and immersing themselves in
                                different cultures and experiences.
                            </li>
                            <li class="list-item">
                                <span class="bold-text">Flexibility and
                                    Adaptability:</span> Individuals high in
                                Openness are flexible in their thinking
                                and adaptable to change. They are
                                open-minded and receptive to new information
                                and ideas, and they may readily adjust their
                                beliefs and perspectives based on new
                                evidence or experiences.
                            </li>
                            <li class="list-item">
                                <span class="bold-text">Appreciation of
                                    Beauty and Aesthetics:</span> High
                                Openness
                                individuals have a deep
                                appreciation for beauty, whether in art,
                                nature, music, or literature. They are often
                                drawn to aesthetic experiences and may
                                derive pleasure from exploring the beauty
                                and complexity of the world around them.
                            </li>
                            <li class="list-item">
                                <span class="bold-text">Intellectual
                                    Engagement:</span> People high in
                                Openness are
                                intellectually engaged and
                                enjoy engaging in deep, meaningful
                                conversations. They may seek out
                                opportunities
                                for intellectual stimulation and may enjoy
                                debating ideas and concepts with others.
                            </li>
                            <li class="list-item">
                                <span class="bold-text">Tolerance for
                                    Ambiguity:</span> High Openness
                                individuals are
                                comfortable with ambiguity
                                and uncertainty. They are less threatened by
                                ambiguity and are more willing to
                                tolerate and even embrace the complexities
                                and uncertainties of life.
                            </li>
