                            excitement, often seeking out new experiences
                            and adventures.
                        </li>
                        <li class="list-item">
                            <span class="bold-text">Assertiveness:</span>
                            Extraverts are comfortable taking the lead in
                            social interactions and may
                            enjoy being the center of attention. They are
                            assertive in expressing themselves and are
                            often skilled communicators who can easily
                            engage others in conversation.
                        </li>
