                            adversity. They may engage in
                            problem-solving, seek social support, or
                            practice relaxation techniques to alleviate
                            stress and promote well-being.
                        </li>
                        <li class="list-item">
                            <span class="bold-text">Focus on the
                                Present:</span> People low in neuroticism
