                                        href="#Building-Aircraft-or-Avionics-Equipment-Mechanic-or-Technician">Read
                                        more</a> </p>
                                <p><span class="bold-text">Airline or Commercial Pilot </span></p>
                                <p class="small-font">A career as an Airline or Commercial
                                    Pilot involves piloting aircraft to
